  "\n" "警告：将 'long' 与 '__vector' 一起使用已弃用">, InGroup<Deprecated>;

def err_redeclaration_different_type : Error<
  "redeclaration of %0 with a different type%diff{: $ vs $|}1,2"
  "\n" "错误：%0 以不同类型的重新声明%diff{：$ 与 $|}1,2">;
def err_bad_variable_name : Error<
  "%0 cannot be the name of a variable or data member"
  "\n" "错误：%0 不能是变量或数据成员的名称">;
def err_bad_parameter_name : Error<
  "%0 cannot be the name of a parameter"
  "\n" "错误：%0 不能是参数的名称">;
def err_bad_parameter_name_template_id : Error<
  "parameter name cannot have template arguments"
  "\n" "错误：参数名不能有模板实参">;
def ext_parameter_name_omitted_c23 : ExtWarn<
  "omitting the parameter name in a function definition is a C23 extension"
  "\n" "警告：在函数定义中省略参数名是 C23 扩展">,
  InGroup<C23>;
def err_anyx86_interrupt_attribute : Error<
  "%select{x86|x86-64}0 'interrupt' attribute only applies to functions that "
  "have %select{a 'void' return type|"
  "only a pointer parameter optionally followed by an integer parameter|"
  "a pointer as the first parameter|a %2 type as the second parameter}1"
  "\n" "错误：%select{x86|x86-64}0 'interrupt' 特性仅适用于具有"
  "%select{'void' 返回类型|"
  "仅一个指针参数（可选地后跟一个整数参数）|"
  "以指针作为第一个参数|以 %2 类型作为第二个参数}1的函数">;
def err_anyx86_interrupt_called : Error<
  "interrupt service routine cannot be called directly"
  "\n" "错误：中断服务例程不能直接调用">;
def warn_anyx86_excessive_regsave : Warning<
  "%select{interrupt service routine|function with attribute"
  " 'no_caller_saved_registers'}0 should only call a function"
  " with attribute 'no_caller_saved_registers'"
  " or be compiled with '-mgeneral-regs-only'"
  "\n" "警告：%select{中断服务例程|具有 'no_caller_saved_registers' 特性的函数}0只应调用"
  "具有 'no_caller_saved_registers' 特性的函数，"
  "或使用 '-mgeneral-regs-only' 编译">,
  InGroup<DiagGroup<"excessive-regsave">>;
def warn_arm_interrupt_vfp_clobber : Warning<
  "interrupt service routine with vfp enabled may clobber the "
  "interruptee's vfp state; "
  "consider using the `interrupt_save_fp` attribute to prevent this behavior"
  "\n" "警告：启用了 vfp 的中断服务例程可能会破坏被中断者的 vfp 状态；"
  "请考虑使用 `interrupt_save_fp` 特性来防止此行为">,
  InGroup<DiagGroup<"arm-interrupt-vfp-clobber">>;
def warn_arm_interrupt_save_fp_without_vfp_unit : Warning<
   "`interrupt_save_fp` only applies to targets that have a VFP unit enabled "
   "for this compilation; this will be treated as a regular `interrupt` "
   "attribute"
   "\n" "警告：`interrupt_save_fp` 仅适用于本次编译中启用 VFP 单元的目标；"
   "这将被视为普通的 `interrupt` 特性">,
   InGroup<DiagGroup<"arm-interrupt-save-fp-no-vfp-unit">>;
def err_arm_interrupt_called : Error<
  "interrupt service routine cannot be called directly"
  "\n" "错误：中断服务例程不能直接调用">;
def warn_interrupt_signal_attribute_invalid
    : Warning<"%select{MIPS|MSP430|RISC-V|AVR}0 '%select{interrupt|signal}1' "
              "attribute only applies to functions that have "
              "%select{no parameters|a 'void' return type}2"
              "\n" "警告：%select{MIPS|MSP430|RISC-V|AVR}0 '%select{interrupt|signal}1' "
              "特性仅适用于%select{无参数|具有 'void' 返回类型}2的函数">,
