  "add a tag name here to establish linkage prior to definition"
  "\n" "错误：不支持：匿名类型在其链接被计算后被 %select{typedef|alias}0 声明赋予名称以用于链接目的；"
  "请在此添加标签名以在定义之前建立链接">;
def note_non_c_like_anon_struct : Note<
  "type is not C-compatible due to this "
