    : Error<"conflicting %select{'overflow_behavior' attributes|overflow "
            "behavior specification; specifier specifies '%1' but attribute "
            "specifies "
            "'%2'}0 on the same type"
            "\n" "错误：同一类型上的%select{'overflow_behavior' 特性|溢出"
