              "\n" "警告：多余的溢出行为规范；说明符和特性都指定了 '%0'">,
      InGroup<OverflowBehaviorAttributeIgnored>;
def warn_impcast_overflow_behavior_assignment
    : Warning<"implicit conversion from %0 to %1 during assignment discards "
