  "partial specialization|__if_exists name|__if_not_exists name|lambda|block|"
  "type constraint|requirement|requires clause}0 "
  "contains%plural{0: an|:}1 unexpanded parameter pack"
  "%plural{0:|1: %2|2:s %2 and %3|:s %2, %3, ...}1"
  "\n" "错误：%select{表达式|基类型|声明类型|数据成员类型|位域"
  "大小|静态断言|固定底层类型|枚举项值|"
  "using 声明|friend 声明|限定符|初始化器|默认实参|"
  "非类型模板形参类型|异常类型|显式特化|"
  "部分特化|__if_exists 名称|__if_not_exists 名称|lambda|块|"
  "类型约束|要求|requires 子句}0 "
  "包含%plural{0: 一个|:}1未展开的参数包"
  "%plural{0:|1: %2|2: %2 和 %3|: %2、%3 等}1">;

def err_pack_expansion_without_parameter_packs : Error<
