  "negative enumerators of enum %1 will be converted to positive values"
  "\n" "警告：将有符号枚举类型 %1 的值赋给无符号位域 %0；"
  "枚举 %1 的负枚举项将被转换为正值">,
  InGroup<BitFieldEnumConversion>, DefaultIgnore;
def warn_signed_bitfield_enum_conversion : Warning<
