  "use of the %0 attribute is a C++20 extension" "\n" "警告：使用 %0 属性是 C++20 扩展">, InGroup<CXX20Attrs>;
def ext_cxx23_attr : Extension<
  "use of the %0 attribute is a C++23 extension" "\n" "警告：使用 %0 属性是 C++23 扩展">, InGroup<CXX23Attrs>;

