  "import %select{module|name}0 (%1) does not match the import %select{module|name}0 (%2) of the "
  "previous declaration"
  "\n" "警告：导入%select{模块|名称}0（%1）与先前声明的导入%select{模块|名称}0（%2）"
  "不匹配">,
  InGroup<IgnoredAttributes>;
